This isn't a direct response to above, but it is what I have been thinking about and above had some influence on it along with our talk and my talk with Adi today.\
\
Zone restructure, now vs later.\
\
The routing team has definitely seen its share of chaos with attrition and possibly the wrong people being in the wrong positions. With Sophie thinking about going back to being an IC, I think this gives us a chance to do a small restructure while we really think about what this zone should be. Do we combine the teams outright? I don't know if that is the right call. She has mostly P3s under her, plus a sr and a staff.\
\
I think there is a different path for 2026. I was talking about the routing team needing to be a bit more stacked so I think a smart move would be to review the engineers on both of our teams, choose who would fit best on routing, and then provide some resources to other teams.I still think we bring in a P4 from the outside, especially if Charles is that person because one thing I have seen is most people who have been here a bit have some baggage. We need to respect that, but also try to mitigate it at the same time.\
\
We use Sophie moving back to IC as the catalyst for the 2026 change. Then for 2027, we let everyone know that we are going to be really trying to understand the work that is coming along with what we currently have and see if we should make some larger changes for 2027. This will let everyone know we are handling our current events respectfully and then really putting effort into what this zone looks like in the next 18-24 months.\
\
A few things this does in my mind. First, it helps Vince get some people he trusts next to him. It gives anyone who isn't familiar with what the team owns more people to go to so we don't continue to concentrate around Vince. And we bring in some fresh people who can see things with clear eyes who can give us some longevity that people who are carrying baggage might not. If we pull it off, we get some quick wins when it comes to the keystone blockers, and derisk the zone. Hopefully that also comes with people who have been here seeing positive changes and possibly giving us more time with them.\
\
100% not fully thought out, but I wanted to make sure you could noodle on it.a bit while I continue thinking as well.\
